OL,3,GNEWSAKey route to close for weekend
OL,4,Aroadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers face a weekend closure of a
OL,7,Fmajor route as roadworks continue.
OL,9,FThe A417 will be closed in both
OL,10,Fdirections between Shab Hill junction
OL,11,Fand the A429 Burford Road from 23:00
OL,12,FGMT until 06:00 on Monday.
OL,14,FNational Highways said the closure was
OL,15,Fneeded to complete work on the Missing
OL,16,FLink project at Cowley junction and to
OL,17,Fopen a northbound slip road. The work
OL,18,Fwill allow drivers travelling north
OL,19,Ffrom Cirencester to leave the A417 at
OL,20,FCowley junction and continue towards
OL,21,FBirdlip via the old A417.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
